Hybrid Connection: Use Azure App Service Hybrid Connections to securely connect to on-prem SQL.

VPN Gateway: Set up a VPN gateway between Azure and your on-premises environment.

Private Link: If SQL is hosted in Azure, use Private Link for secure connections.



